  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently VRChat's OSCQuery server is started the moment you enable OSC through the action menu, or when VRChat starts with this option already enabled. However, once you disable OSC through the action menu, the OSCQuery server keeps running and remains accessible, until you restart the game.\n\nIt would be nice if the game would stop the OSCQuery server (and stop listening on its port) when OSC is disabled, without having to restart the game.\n\nThis would enable us to more easily determine whether OSC is enabled in VRChat by polling.",
